cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: potlibc
abstract: >-
  potlibc provides a stable C ABI for all 387 surface versions in the PotLib
  2023 deposit. Each handle loads a private in-memory copy of its generated
  surface plugin, isolating Fortran COMMON and SAVE state without a global
  lock or an ELF namespace per handle. Every surface provides energy, analytic
  forces, and a forward-dual Hessian-vector product without materializing the
  Hessian.
